          %p
            The original proposal for formalizing notions of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mathematical+structures"} mathematical structures
            via
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/forgetful+functors"} forgetful functors
            between the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoids"} groupoids
            which they form:
          %ul
            %li#Ehresmann57
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Ehresmann"}> Charles Ehresmann
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gattungen von lokalen Strukturen
                %strong 60
                (1958) 49-77 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://eudml.org/doc/146434"}> dml:146434
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#Ehresmann65
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Ehresmann"}> Charles Ehresmann
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Catégories et Structures
                %strong 6
                (1964) 1-31 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=SE_1964__6__A8_0"}> numdam:SE_1964__6__A8_0
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://eudml.org/doc/112200"} dml:112200
          %p Exposition and re-amplification:
          %ul
            %li#BaezBartelsDolan98
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/qg-spring2004/discussion.html"} original UseNet discussion
                on
                %code sci.physics.research
                in 1998;
            %li
              %p
                a pedagogical comparison to quadratic, linear, and constant polynomials (
                %a{:href => "http://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/qg-spring2004/polynomials.pdf"}> PDF
                ) by Toby Bartels in 2004;
            %li#BaezShulman06
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/PS_cache/math/pdf/0608/0608420v2.pdf#page=15"} section 2.4, p. 15
                and
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/PS_cache/math/pdf/0608/0608420v2.pdf#page=17"} section 3.1, p. 17
                of J. Baez and M. Shulman,
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lectures+on+n-Categories+and+Cohomology"} Lectures on n-Categories and Cohomology
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0608420"}> arXiv
                ).
          %p
